{"seq":1,"slug":"sensor-data-pipeline","title":"传感器数据管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-applications/sensor-data-pipeline","wordCount":911,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"传感器数据管线\">传感器数据管线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传感器数据管线（Sensor Data Pipeline）是 IoT 系统的数据骨架，负责将传感器原始信号经过采集、校准、过滤、传输、存储和分析的完整流程。一条设计良好的数据管线需要在数据质量、延迟、吞吐量和资源消耗之间取得平衡。从嵌入式固件中的 ADC 采样到云端的时序数据库存储，每个环节都有其特定的技术挑战。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[传感器] --&gt; B[ADC 采样]&#10;    B --&gt; C[信号调理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[数字滤波]&#10;    D --&gt; E[数据校准]&#10;    E --&gt; F[本地缓存]&#10;    F --&gt; G[协议编码]&#10;    G --&gt; H[网络传输]&#10;    H --&gt; I[边缘聚合]&#10;    I --&gt; J[云端存储]\">graph LR\n    A[传感器] --&gt; B[ADC 采样]\n    B --&gt; C[信号调理]\n    C --&gt; D[数字滤波]\n    D --&gt; E[数据校准]\n    E --&gt; F[本地缓存]\n    F --&gt; G[协议编码]\n    G --&gt; H[网络传输]\n    H --&gt; I[边缘聚合]\n    I --&gt; J[云端存储]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管线阶段</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>数据量变化</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ADC 采样</td>\n<td>MCU</td>\n<td>μs 级</td>\n<td>原始 → 数字</td>\n<td>DMA、多通道扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号调理</td>\n<td>MCU</td>\n<td>μs 级</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>放大、偏置、阻抗匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字滤波</td>\n<td>MCU</td>\n<td>μs-ms</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>移动平均、卡尔曼、IIR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据校准</td>\n<td>MCU</td>\n<td>μs</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>多点标定、温度补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议编码</td>\n<td>MCU/网关</td>\n<td>ms</td>\n<td>压缩</td>\n<td>Protobuf、CBOR、JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络传输</td>\n<td>通信模块</td>\n<td>ms-s</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>MQTT、CoAP、LoRaWAN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘聚合</td>\n<td>网关</td>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>大幅压缩</td>\n<td>窗口聚合、异常过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云端存储</td>\n<td>云平台</td>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>InfluxDB、TimescaleDB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"adc-采样与-dma\">ADC 采样与 DMA</h2><h3 id=\"高效多通道采样\">高效多通道采样</h3><p>使用 DMA（Direct Memory Access）实现 ADC 多通道连续采样，不占用 CPU 时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// STM32 HAL ADC + DMA 多通道采样&#10;#define ADC_CHANNELS 4&#10;#define BUFFER_SIZE 256&#10;&#10;static uint16_t adc_buffer[ADC_CHANNELS * BUFFER_SIZE];&#10;&#10;void adc_dma_init(void) {&#10;    HAL_ADC_Start_DMA(&amp;hadc1, (uint32_t *)adc_buffer,&#10;                      ADC_CHANNELS * BUFFER_SIZE);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback(ADC_HandleTypeDef *hadc) {&#10;    process_adc_batch(&amp;adc_buffer[ADC_CHANNELS * BUFFER_SIZE / 2],&#10;                      BUFFER_SIZE / 2);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void HAL_ADC_ConvHalfCpltCallback(ADC_HandleTypeDef *hadc) {&#10;    process_adc_batch(&amp;adc_buffer[0], BUFFER_SIZE / 2);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// STM32 HAL ADC + DMA 多通道采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ADC_CHANNELS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BUFFER_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> adc_buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[ADC_CHANNELS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BUFFER_SIZE];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> adc_dma_init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_ADC_Start_DMA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hadc1, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)adc_buffer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                      ADC_CHANNELS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BUFFER_SIZE);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ADC_HandleTypeDef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hadc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process_adc_batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">adc_buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[ADC_CHANNELS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BUFFER_SIZE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                      BUFFER_SIZE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HAL_ADC_ConvHalfCpltCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ADC_HandleTypeDef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hadc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process_adc_batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">adc_buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], BUFFER_SIZE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"采样率与精度权衡\">采样率与精度权衡</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传感器类型</th>\n<th>典型采样率</th>\n<th>ADC 位数</th>\n<th>信噪比要求</th>\n<th>采样策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>1-10 Hz</td>\n<td>12-16 bit</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低频定时采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加速度</td>\n<td>100-1000 Hz</td>\n<td>12-16 bit</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>连续 DMA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频</td>\n<td>8-48 kHz</td>\n<td>16-24 bit</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>I2S + DMA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电压/电流</td>\n<td>1-100 kHz</td>\n<td>12-16 bit</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>过采样 + 平均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>30-120 fps</td>\n<td>8-12 bit</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>专用图像接口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数字滤波算法\">数字滤波算法</h2><h3 id=\"常用滤波器\">常用滤波器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 指数移动平均滤波（EMA）&#10;typedef struct {&#10;    float alpha;&#10;    float output;&#10;    bool initialized;&#10;} ema_filter_t;&#10;&#10;float ema_update(ema_filter_t *f, float input) {&#10;    if (!f-&gt;initialized) {&#10;        f-&gt;output = input;&#10;        f-&gt;initialized = true;&#10;    } else {&#10;        f-&gt;output = f-&gt;alpha * input + (1.0f - f-&gt;alpha) * f-&gt;output;&#10;    }&#10;    return f-&gt;output;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 中值滤波（去除脉冲噪声）&#10;#define MEDIAN_WINDOW 5&#10;float median_filter(float *buffer, int size) {&#10;    float sorted[MEDIAN_WINDOW];&#10;    memcpy(sorted, buffer, size * sizeof(float));&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; size - 1; i++) {&#10;        for (int j = i + 1; j &lt; size; j++) {&#10;            if (sorted[j] &lt; sorted[i]) {&#10;                float tmp = sorted[i];&#10;                sorted[i] = sorted[j];&#10;                sorted[j] = tmp;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return sorted[size / 2];&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 简化卡尔曼滤波（一维）&#10;typedef struct {&#10;    float q;  // 过程噪声&#10;    float r;  // 测量噪声&#10;    float x;  // 估计值&#10;    float p;  // 估计协方差&#10;} kalman_1d_t;&#10;&#10;float kalman_update(kalman_1d_t *kf, float measurement) {&#10;    kf-&gt;p += kf-&gt;q;&#10;    float k = kf-&gt;p / (kf-&gt;p + kf-&gt;r);  // 卡尔曼增益&#10;    kf-&gt;x += k * (measurement - kf-&gt;x);&#10;    kf-&gt;p *= (1.0f - k);&#10;    return kf-&gt;x;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 指数移动平均滤波（EMA）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initialized;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ema_filter_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ema_update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ema_filter_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span styl